Players Committee remade full D-E1 face for [[Blast The Door, Kid! (PC Errata 4)]], retained from [https://wiki.swccg.com/images/6/6b/ANH-L-blastthedoorkid.gif the existing Wiki original] (upload 22 September 2026 at 14:50:28 UTC). Despite its historical .gif filename, the native payload is PNG; its bytes are unchanged.

Reference source: [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/swccgpc/holotable/6c2273e5dc7fba63359a7ab12cd8f2bcc801b172/Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/hires/blastthedoorkid.png exact official PC PNG] from swccgpc/holotable commit 6c2273e5dc7fba63359a7ab12cd8f2bcc801b172, member <code style="overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:normal">Images-HT/starwars/ANewHope-Light/hires/blastthedoorkid.png</code>. The Wiki original and reference are decoded-RGB pixel-identical at 745×1039; file-byte identity is not claimed. Repository occurrence: 2022-11-12T02:32:29Z, not an established first-publication day.

